usage: hive-appliance [-h] [--store STORE] [--store-dir STORE_DIR]
                      {observe,profile,incidents,state,events,repair,run-plan,checkpoint,restore,upgrade}
                      ...

Omega Hive Appliance CLI

positional arguments:
  {observe,profile,incidents,state,events,repair,run-plan,checkpoint,restore,upgrade}
    observe             Run collectors
    profile             Discover hive profile
    incidents           List open incidents
    state               Show state snapshot
    events              List recent events
    repair              Repair open incidents
    run-plan            Execute a plan from JSON
    checkpoint          Take a state checkpoint
    restore             Restore from checkpoint
    upgrade             Execute an upgrade manifest

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --store STORE         Event store path
  --store-dir STORE_DIR
                        Profile store directory
